として夜蘭の住まいに連れてかれ　以下同文\n\n\n煙緋は帽子脱がせても構いません。Hや夜蘭の家の中の際には2人とも服は脱いで脱がされて裸で\n煙緋に目隠しや夜蘭の糸による首輪や拘束的な表現や差分も良ければ\n\n個人的に中出し射精以外にもキス系(キスハメ・ディープキス・ベロチュー等)の描写等も…！\n\n\n改めてこんな内容かつ全体的にボリュームある内容かつ細かで長々としてしまいましたが…\n検討よろしくお願いします！！", "nc": 176, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 37714, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "餅屋あん子", "screen_name": "mochiyanoanko", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1778351607320805376/m2YImr9Z.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1778118363061035008/1712827038/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}], "banned": false, "nc": 49}, {"id": 412423, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "狐ねこ", "screen_name": "Koneko00", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/498738004609859584/5-FWrEbd.png", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/64484874/1637353747/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 10, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 49}, {"id": 461291, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "かいかい skeb チョコ中毒者skeb停止中", "screen_name": "xbN1CA3shRJtYqV", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1907268843678109696/CLUBzyRw.jpg", "header_url": null, "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiratio